    },
    "text": "The English subtext:\n\n\"So if I asked you about art, you'd probably give me the skinny on every art book ever written. Michelangelo, know a lot about him. Life's work, political aspirations, him and the pope, sexual orientation, the whole works, right? I bet you can't tell me what…",
